<title>UK: LIFFE cocoa slips, coffee up, sugar mixed in AM.</title>
<headline>LIFFE cocoa slips, coffee up, sugar mixed in AM.</headline>
<text>
<p>COCOA - July falls to lowest since April 10 after large, European firm sells 300 July and 100 May, traders said. At 1020 GMT, July down 14 at 1,020.</p>
<p>COFFEE - Up but July hits but fails to break $1,700 resistance. July up $28 at $1,690.</p>
<p>SUGAR - Tightly mixed in decent volume. August up 80 cents at 310.0.</p>
</text>
